00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:56.280
Same scenario.

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:57.880
A lot of complex operations.

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:59.740
A lot of components.

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:02.320
Now these
automations-- and as we

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:04.660
