00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:35.600
point to the various
elements here

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:38.780
that, by using
predictive maintenance,

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:42.960
you can do a lot better with
your maintenance activities

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:45.140
and keep your equipment up.

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:48.440
You can reduce the maintenance
costs by up to 25%.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:52.290
You can eliminate breakdowns
by 70%, and so on and so forth.

00:07:52.290 --> 00:08:02.030
So I will also say that you are
able to give the benefit back

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:04.850
to your shareholders by
using predictive maintenance

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:07.650
for the C-level execs
out here in the audience.

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:14.130
Now, it's no strange news
to you that our world is

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:16.870
interconnected, and
some of the studies

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:20.260
that have been
