00:38:47.750 --> 00:38:52.550
So how do we make
these cities better?

00:38:52.550 --> 00:38:56.480
Again, we talked about sensors
and interconnected IoT devices.

00:38:56.480 --> 00:38:58.730
So there's real-time
monitoring that

00:38:58.730 --> 00:39:02.960
